; Terminal capability detection + low-level escape helpers, in their OWN tiny library so BOTH the
; `fennec dev` UI and the console driver can share them without either pulling in the other (the
; driver and the dev supervisor must not form a dependency cycle). Pure string-building over a
; once-detected capability record; (wrapped false) keeps the module name a bare `Tty`.
(library
 (name fennec_tty)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries unix))
